    {
      "entity_name": "European Maritime Safety Agency (EMSA)",
      "jurisdiction": "European Union",
      "role": "Oversight of maritime safety and environmental compliance"
    }
  ]
}
```

If no regulatory content is detected, the output will be:  

```json
